@startuml F5.11-D03-confirmar-colacao
title F5.11-D03 — Confirmar colação em lote
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "GraduationController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar colação
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /diplomas
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT N graduation_record\n+ audit_log\n+ outbox × N
note right of Ctrl
  TX única; sem role=EGRESSO
  (CA-03 / FGAC 4.11)
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Sec: colação registrada

@enduml
